from pathlib import Path
from zipfile import ZipFile
archive=next(Path('artifacts/analog_asic/documentation_history').glob('project_docs_before_routed_sc_packet_*.zip'))
with ZipFile(archive) as z:
    active=z.read('ACTIVE_TASKS.md').decode('utf-8')
    spec=z.read('project_spec.yaml').decode('utf-8')
lines=active.splitlines()
i=next(i for i,x in enumerate(lines) if x.startswith('**Full article assembly remains the goal.'))
lines[i]='**Current stage: routed switched-capacitor state packet integration and calibration.** GF180 compact parent v12 is 0.0493 mm² and passes full Magic DRC, unique LVS, and GDS readback. Extracted center-state tests now deliver +8.01 mV / -8.10 mV and hold within 0.04 mV over 5 ms after layout-specific packet-step calibration. The same map is not yet valid at low/high states: prior sparse settings produce +18.36/+2.86 mV low and +7.81/-6.73 mV high, with 12–14 mV beta/handoff errors. Directly labeling single-source control pins removed large control-to-state coupling seen in the first parent. Continue calibrating the beta, baseline, and signed packet map at the endpoints, then dense state/weight coverage and original-float recurrence. Physical range detection, sequencer, parameter-to-voltage mapping, population service, and full-chip assembly/layout remain open. This is article-suitable research implementation, not manufacture-ready signoff.'
i=next(i for i,x in enumerate(lines) if x.startswith('2. The routed limiter composite v10'))
lines[i]='2. **Switched-capacitor membrane update parent:** v12 is the compact routed candidate (0.0493 mm²; full DRC/LVS/GDS readback pass). Layout-specific center calibration yields +8.01/-8.10mV updates with 0.04mV 5ms hold drift. Endpoint transfer and beta/handoff still differ from the earlier child-only calibration; calibrate low/high beta response and baseline/packet amplitude before claiming full-range accuracy. Evidence: `artifacts/analog_asic/layout/gf180_sc_state_packet_compact_v12/qualification.json`, `artifacts/analog_asic/results/gf180_sc_state_packet_compact_v12_center_recalibrated_5ms_v2.json`, and `artifacts/analog_asic/results/gf180_sc_state_packet_compact_v12_endpoints_staggered_5ms_v2.json`.'
Path('docs/ACTIVE_TASKS.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
old='  current_stage: "Direct float mapping Vcap = 1.65 V + 0.9 V * state / R_tile spans the native 0.75-2.55 V range; selecting R_tile for rare tails remains open. Routed limiter parent v10 passes DRC/LVS/GDS readback and combined extracted TT27 5 ms outward endpoint transients with calibrated rails. External controls and ideal packet current; compact macro, physical range detector, actual packet mapping, full-float PLIF recurrence, and full-chip assembly/layout remain open."'
new='  current_stage: "GF180 routed switched-capacitor state packet parent v12 passes full Magic DRC, unique LVS, and GDS readback at 0.0493 mm2. Layout-specific center-state extracted transient delivers +8.01/-8.10mV with 0.04mV drift over 5ms. Endpoint beta/handoff and packet maps remain mismatched; calibrate full voltage span, then dense weight/state coverage and original-float PLIF replay. Physical sequencer/range detector, population service, and full-chip assembly/layout remain incomplete; article-suitable, not manufacture-ready."'
assert old in spec
Path('docs/project_spec.yaml').write_text(spec.replace(old,new),encoding='utf-8')
